  {
    "record": "GCVE-110-VULN-PYPI-2026-000637",
    "updated_at": "2026-10-28T01:49:28Z",
    "affected": [
      {
        "package": "aimarket-oracle-core",
        "versions": [
          {
            "lessThanOrEqual": "0.6.2",
            "status": "affected",
            "version": "0.2.0",
            "versionType": "python"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "solutions": [
      {
        "lang": "en",
        "value": "If you do not sell the paid tier through a hub, leave ORACLE_TRUSTED_PAYMENT_PROXIES unset: no caller is then lifted above the free ceiling. ORACLE_PAID_TIER_SECRET does not replace it for hub traffic, because aimarket-hub (through 3.16.0) never sends the X-AIMarket-Paid-Tier header."
      },
      {
        "lang": "en",
        "value": "Bind the oracle to the loopback interface and reach it only through a reverse proxy on the same host."
      }
    ],
    "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vulnetix/advisory-database/main/cvelistv5/VULN-PYPI/2026/0xxx/GCVE-110-VULN-PYPI-2026-000637.json"
  },
  {
    "record": "GCVE-110-VULN-PYPI-2026-000638",
    "updated_at": "2026-10-28T01:49:28Z",
    "affected": [
      {
        "package": "aimarket-logos",
        "versions": [
          {
            "lessThanOrEqual": "0.2.1",
            "status": "affected",
            "version": "0.1.0",
            "versionType": "python"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "solutions": [
      {
        "lang": "en",
        "value": "Start the app on loopback, for example uvicorn logos.main:app --host 127.0.0.1 --port <LOGOS_PORT>, instead of the logos entry point, and reach it only through a reverse proxy on the same host."
      }
    ],
    "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vulnetix/advisory-database/main/cvelistv5/VULN-PYPI/2026/0xxx/GCVE-110-VULN-PYPI-2026-000638.json"
  },
  {
    "record": "GCVE-110-VULN-PYPI-2026-000639",
    "updated_at": "2026-10-28T01:49:28Z",
    "affected": [
      {
        "package": "skopos-fleet",
        "versions": [
          {
            "lessThanOrEqual": "0.2.1",
            "status": "affected",
            "version": "0.2.0",
            "versionType": "python"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "solutions": [
      {
        "lang": "en",
        "value": "Name the git server by a fully qualified name in SKOPOS_AGENT_REPO_URL, and add its host key, checked out of band, to SKOPOS's known_hosts (SKOPOS_KNOWN_HOSTS): in 0.2.1 such a remote is verified."
      },
      {
        "lang": "en",
        "value": "Or push over HTTPS: an https:// SKOPOS_AGENT_REPO_URL with SKOPOS_GIT_TOKEN set and SKOPOS_GIT_SSH_KEY unset."
      },
      {
        "lang": "en",
        "value": "Where SKOPOS runs on the host itself, a loopback remote such as a Gitea port published on 127.0.0.1 is not reachable by a neighbour."
      }
    ],
    "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vulnetix/advisory-database/main/cvelistv5/VULN-PYPI/2026/0xxx/GCVE-110-VULN-PYPI-2026-000639.json"
  },
  {
    "record": "GCVE-110-VULN-PYPI-2026-000640",
    "updated_at": "2026-10-28T01:49:28Z",
    "affected": [
      {
        "package": "aimarket-mcp",
        "versions": [
          {
            "lessThanOrEqual": "0.6.3",
            "status": "affected",
            "version": "0.1.0",
            "versionType": "python"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "solutions": [
      {
        "lang": "en",
        "value": "Set AIMARKET_MCP_KEY to a long random value whenever anything relays requests to the HTTP server. This is the only control that works in every affected version."
      }
    ],
    "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vulnetix/advisory-database/main/cvelistv5/VULN-PYPI/2026/0xxx/GCVE-110-VULN-PYPI-2026-000640.json"
  },
  {
